ttendance parser needs both to accept a date consistently with other person attributes.\n\nAdd the date prefix and parse helper with validation and whitespace trimming. Cover valid, invalid, and null inputs so later command parsing can rely on the same behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":17,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":32,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"d4576dd56c6650d2ce808cd5d9c42084409ff4c1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add AttendanceCommand placeholder","messageBody":"Attendance requests need a command representation before recording is added in v1.3.\n\nAdd a command that holds the displayed index and optional date, returns a clear placeholder result, and leaves the model untouched. Keep the date optional so the default date can be decided in v1.3.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":69,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":67,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"dc1381507d4740ba6dea39349422f4a37593426b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add AttendanceCommandParser","messageBody":"The attendance command has a date conversion helper, but no parser turns command arguments into an attendance request.\n\nAdd parsing for a required displayed index and optional date. Reject malformed indices, invalid dates, and duplicate date prefixes with the existing parser error conventions.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":45,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":59,"deletions":0}}}]}],"ed3yuu":[{"date":"2026-09-30T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"ec0ad145068a6a984d2a4edb212fb9d07feadc12","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Edrich\u0027s details in AboutUs","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":5}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"c42d6502ed178112443c09e0e7bbdbd9e8847b44","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"DG: Update use cases, glossary, and NFRs","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndCon